<title>INDIA: India Reliance 1st half result on Oct 18.</title>
<headline>India Reliance 1st half result on Oct 18.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>India's largest private firm Reliance Industries will hold a board meeting on October 18 to release first half results for the six months ended September 30, the Bombay Stock Exchange said in a notice on Monday.</p>
<p>A Reuter poll of 14 leading securities houses last week found the petrochemical giant's first half net profit is headed for a steep 25.8 percent fall to 4.7 billion rupees from the year ago.</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom +91-22-265 9000</p>
</text>
